<<~ ahu #/ground-and-readings>>

!! Ground and Readings ~ one ground, a lattice of readings, the chain as spine

* ''The GROUND'' ~ verbatim bytes + position: the identity partition, what every reading reads; append-only — ground never carries derived (`rederive` walks it; the annotate-shore law holds it).
* ''The SHAPE READING'' ~ the expression-variance quotient: the canonical parse shape + structural hash. Its live instrument: the AST-hash collision rate + subsample entropy curve read whether the quotient coarsens or canonicalizes — the plane-carriage figure speaks through that measurement.
* ''The IDIOM READING'' ~ recurrence-of-shape templates, MDL-priced. It claims recurrence, never meaning: constructions pair form with MEANING and cross-cut shape (Goldberg/Croft — one shape hosts many constructions; one construction spans shapes), so meaning-level regularity rides other members.
* ''The MEANING BRAID'' ~ three strata, three warrants: DECLARED (registry fiat) · ENACTED (witnessed execution) · USED (bit-priced distribution — the vMF reading that prices admission and serves semantic recall). It rides a SECOND lattice axis: the Equitz–Cover admission test holds it off the chain, because cross-shape synonymy never factors through the shape hash.
* ''The CONSTRUCTICON JOIN'' ~ the fuzzy-constructicon MOVE-vectors: idiom × meaning-braid, the lattice join — the plane this meme's registers and sanction-degrees describe, buildable by name.

The geometry whole: ''one GROUND · the li spine (shape ↠ idiom) · cross-cutting axes (the meaning braid · the ki readings) — a LATTICE carrying one proven chain.'' Palace-names serve as syād-handles — standpoint addresses, true-in-some-sense — never as buildings.

